<p align="justify">Murhum : Jurnal Pendidikan Anak Usia Dini accredited<a title="SINTA3" href="https://sinta.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/journals/profile/9519" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong> SINTA 3</strong></a> based on Decree Number <strong><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xVSJbFcF_2W9NxvPhfBocgF_9wwheEav/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10/C/C3/DT.05.00/2025, March 21, 2025.</a></strong></p>
<p align="justify"><strong>Murhum : jurnal Pendidikan Anak Usia Dini</strong> is a journal that publishes <strong>research and service articles</strong> on the scientific concept of PAUD is isomorphic, meaning that the scientific framework of PAUD is built from interdisciplinary science which is a combination of several disciplines, including: psychology, sociology, child education , anthropology, humanities, health, and nutrition as well as neuro science or the science of human brain development.</p>
<p align="justify"> </p>
<p align="left"> </p>
